<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11272" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπάλαιστρος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[πᾰ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not trained in the
				palaestra, unskilled in wrestling,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				12.222
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Strat.
			</span></i>); opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ μετέχοντες τοῦ
				γυμνασίου,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>CIG</u>
				3086
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Teos</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally, <i>awkward, clumsy,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Cic.
				<u>Orat.</u>
				68.229
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Quint.
				<u>Inst.</u>
				9.4.56
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1.8
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>not customary in the palaestra, contrary to its rules,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				5.213
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Mel.
			</span></i>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
